WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.598
Welcome.

00:00:01.548 --> 00:00:07.630
In this guide you will create a course on The African Dream Lab, from the first idea to publishing.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:10.260
Everything starts in Authoring.

00:00:11.226 --> 00:00:13.753
Give the course a clear title.

00:00:13.703 --> 00:00:16.646
The web address is filled in for you.

00:00:16.646 --> 00:00:19.003
Then choose Start writing.

00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:23.351
A new course begins with four short steps.

00:00:23.301 --> 00:00:30.970
First, the basics: a subtitle that sells it in one line, and a description of what the course is about.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:37.290
Next, who it is for, and what learners will be able to do by the end.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:41.654
Write each outcome on its own line, and aim for three or more.

00:00:42.619 --> 00:00:45.746
You can add a cover photo now or later.

00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:50.826
Then name your first module and its first lesson, and choose Start writing.

00:00:50.826 --> 00:00:54.563
Every answer can be changed later in Course details.
